sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Worker
  participant W as Wearable
  participant H as Event History Buffer
  participant R as Radio Link
  participant B as Base Receiver
  participant D as Dashboard
  U->>W: Press SOS button
  W->>W: Debounce and accept press
  W->>H: Freeze/mark preceding event history
  W->>W: Latch emergency state and activate local alerts
  W->>R: Send priority SOS packet
  R->>B: Deliver packet when link is available
  B->>B: Validate packet / detect duplicate if supported
  B->>D: Raise event and record receiver timestamp
  B-->>W: ACK if supported by release protocol
  W->>R: Retry according to configured policy if required
